    {Key="No guards are available. Guards already in combat cannot be selected.",Source="No guards are available. Guards already in combat cannot be selected.",Values={["en-us"]="No guards are available. Guards already in combat cannot be selected.",["ru"]="Свободных дозорных нет. Вступившего в бой выбрать уже нельзя."}},
