    {Key="This guard is no longer available. Choose another from the list.",Source="This guard is no longer available. Choose another from the list.",Values={["en-us"]="This guard is no longer available. Choose another from the list.",["ru"]="Этот дозорный больше недоступен. Выберите другого из списка."}},
