    {Key="The heroes crossed six districts, defeated the Guardian and opened the exit.",Source="The heroes crossed six districts, defeated the Guardian and opened the exit.",Values={["en-us"]="The heroes crossed six districts, defeated the Guardian and opened the exit.",["ru"]="Герои прошли шесть районов, победили стража и открыли выход."}},
    {Key="The heroes were stopped on the causeway. The next attempt starts in the first district.",Source="The heroes were stopped on the causeway. The next attempt starts in the first district.",Values={["en-us"]="The heroes were stopped on the causeway. The next attempt starts in the first district.",["ru"]="Герои остановлены на тракте. Следующая попытка начнётся с первого района."}},
    {Key="The heroes defeated the Guardian and opened the gate. Choose a role for the next game.",Source="The heroes defeated the Guardian and opened the gate. Choose a role for the next game.",Values={["en-us"]="The heroes defeated the Guardian and opened the gate. Choose a role for the next game.",["ru"]="Герои победили стража и открыли ворота. Выберите роль для следующей игры."}},
    {Key="The heroes used all their respawns. The causeway is still guarded.",Source="The heroes used all their respawns. The causeway is still guarded.",Values={["en-us"]="The heroes used all their respawns. The causeway is still guarded.",["ru"]="Герои потратили все возвраты. Тракт остался под охраной."}},
    {Key="Six districts cleared. The Guardian fell to heavy balls — the exit is open.",Source="Six districts cleared. The Guardian fell to heavy balls — the exit is open.",Values={["en-us"]="Six districts cleared. The Guardian fell to heavy balls — the exit is open.",["ru"]="Шесть районов пройдены. Страж повержен тяжёлыми шарами — выход открыт."}},
    {Key="The team did not reach the exit. The districts and Guardian await another attempt.",Source="The team did not reach the exit. The districts and Guardian await another attempt.",Values={["en-us"]="The team did not reach the exit. The districts and Guardian await another attempt.",["ru"]="Команда не дошла до выхода. Районы и страж ждут новой попытки."}},
    {Key="The Guardian is defeated. The gate is open — the team reached the exit.",Source="The Guardian is defeated. The gate is open — the team reached the exit.",Values={["en-us"]="The Guardian is defeated. The gate is open — the team reached the exit.",["ru"]="Страж побеждён. Ворота открыты — команда добралась до выхода."}},
    {Key="The heroes have no respawns left. Choose roles and try the causeway again.",Source="The heroes have no respawns left. Choose roles and try the causeway again.",Values={["en-us"]="The heroes have no respawns left. Choose roles and try the causeway again.",["ru"]="Возвраты героев закончились. Выберите роли и попробуйте пройти тракт ещё раз."}},
    {Key="Press “New game” to start the next attempt.",Source="Press “New game” to start the next attempt.",Values={["en-us"]="Press “New game” to start the next attempt.",["ru"]="Следующая попытка начинается по кнопке «Новая игра»."}},
    {Key="HERO FOR THE NEXT GAME",Source="HERO FOR THE NEXT GAME",Values={["en-us"]="HERO FOR THE NEXT GAME",["ru"]="ГЕРОЙ ДЛЯ СЛЕДУЮЩЕЙ ИГРЫ"}},
    {Key="The Guardian is defeated. You can keep watching this game.",Source="The Guardian is defeated. You can keep watching this game.",Values={["en-us"]="The Guardian is defeated. You can keep watching this game.",["ru"]="Страж побеждён. Можно продолжить наблюдать за этой игрой."}},
    {Key="Your only life is over. You can keep watching this game.",Source="Your only life is over. You can keep watching this game.",Values={["en-us"]="Your only life is over. You can keep watching this game.",["ru"]="Ваша единственная жизнь закончилась. Можно продолжить наблюдать за этой игрой."}},
